---
import Guide from './Guide.astro';
import DiscordMessage from './DiscordMessage.astro';
import '../styles/support-flow.css';
---
<section class="support-problem wrap" id="how-it-works" aria-labelledby="problem-title">
  <div class="support-copy"><h2 id="problem-title">People miss<br />earlier answers.</h2><p>A moderator has already answered. The next person starts another thread and asks the same question.</p></div>
  <div class="problem-forum discord-surface" data-ui>
    <div class="discord-channel"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="23" height="23" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 4h15v11H12l-5 4v-4H5V4Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linejoin="round"/><path d="M9 8h7M9 11h4" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg><span>support</span><span class="forum-kind">Forum</span></div>
    <div class="problem-posts">
      <details class="problem-post" open>
        <summary><span class="problem-post__title">Where do I submit my project?<svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" width="16" height="16" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m4 6 4 4 4-4" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></span><span class="problem-post__meta"><span class="problem-answered">Answered</span><span>10:24 AM</span></span></summary>
        <DiscordMessage><p>Post your public GitHub repository in <span class="channel-mention">#submissions</span>.</p></DiscordMessage>
      </details>
      <details class="problem-post">
        <summary><span class="problem-post__title">Is a GitHub link enough?<svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" width="16" height="16" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m4 6 4 4 4-4" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></span><span class="problem-post__meta">No replies yet<span>10:32 AM</span></span></summary>
        <DiscordMessage kind="member" time="10:32 AM"><p>Can I just share the repo?</p></DiscordMessage>
      </details>
      <details class="problem-post">
        <summary><span class="problem-post__title">Where should I send my project?<svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" width="16" height="16" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m4 6 4 4 4-4" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></span><span class="problem-post__meta">No replies yet<span>10:38 AM</span></span></summary>
        <DiscordMessage kind="member" time="10:38 AM"><p>My project is ready. Where do I post the link?</p></DiscordMessage>
      </details>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="support-save wrap" id="save-answer" aria-labelledby="save-title">
  <div class="support-copy"><h2 id="save-title">Save an answer.</h2><p>Right-click a moderator’s reply, then choose <strong>Apps</strong> → <strong>Save this answer</strong>.</p><p class="support-secondary">The bot reuses only the replies a moderator saves.</p></div>
  <div class="save-illustration" data-save-illustration>
    <div class="moderator-reply discord-surface" id="saved-reply" tabindex="-1" data-ui>
      <div class="discord-channel"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="22" height="22" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M9 3 6 21M18 3l-3 18M3 9h18M2 16h18" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg><span>support</span><span class="discord-channel__thread">How do I submit?</span></div>
      <DiscordMessage><p>Post your public GitHub repository in <span class="channel-mention">#submissions</span>.</p></DiscordMessage>
      <div class="save-action" aria-label="Message Apps menu">
        <div class="save-app-path"><svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" width="18" height="18" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="2" y="2" width="6" height="6" rx="1" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"/><rect x="12" y="2" width="6" height="6" rx="1" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"/><rect x="2" y="12" width="6" height="6" rx="1" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"/><rect x="12" y="12" width="6" height="6" rx="1" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"/></svg>Apps<svg class="save-app-chevron" viewBox="0 0 16 16" width="16" height="16" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 4 4 4-4 4" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></div>
        <button type="button" data-save-answer aria-pressed="false"><img src="/brand/avatar.svg" width="24" height="24" alt=""/><span data-save-label>Save this answer</span><svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" width="18" height="18" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m4 10 4 4 8-8" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></button>
        <span class="answer-stamp" data-save-status aria-live="polite"></span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="save-companion"><Guide pose="save"/><span class="saved-caption">Saved answer</span></div>
    <svg class="save-note" viewBox="0 0 40 50" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="2" y="2" width="36" height="46" rx="6" fill="currentColor"/><path d="M12 15h16M12 24h12M12 33h16" stroke="#100f15" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="support-repeat" aria-labelledby="repeat-title">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="repeat-opening">
      <h2 id="repeat-title">The bot watches<br />the forum.</h2>
      <p>ThreadSherpa checks new forum posts against saved answers. When one matches, it writes a reply with a link to the original.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="repeat-map" data-repeat-map role="group" aria-label="A new forum question matches a saved moderator answer. ThreadSherpa replies in the thread and links that answer.">
      <svg class="match-connections" aria-hidden="true">
        <defs><marker id="match-arrow" markerWidth="7" markerHeight="7" refX="5" refY="3.5" orient="auto"><path d="m1 1 4 2.5L1 6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2"/></marker></defs>
        <path class="connection-base" data-connection="question"/>
        <path class="connection-base" data-connection="reply"/>
        <path class="connection-current" data-connection="question" pathLength="1"/>
        <path class="connection-current" data-connection="reply" pathLength="1"/>
      </svg>
      <aside class="match-memory">
        <div class="memory-note discord-surface" data-match-answer data-ui>
          <div class="discord-channel"><svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" width="20" height="20" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 3h10v14l-5-3-5 3V3Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg><span>Saved answer</span></div>
          <DiscordMessage><p>Post your public GitHub repository in <span class="channel-mention">#submissions</span>.</p></DiscordMessage>
          <div class="match-confirmation"><svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" width="20" height="20" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m4 10 4 4 8-8" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>Covers this question</div>
        </div>
        <div class="repeat-guide"><Guide pose="reply"/></div>
      </aside>
      <div class="forum-thread discord-surface" data-ui>
        <div class="discord-channel"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="23" height="23" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 4h15v11H12l-5 4v-4H5V4Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linejoin="round"/><path d="M9 8h7M9 11h4" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg><span>support</span><span class="forum-kind">Forum</span></div>
        <div class="forum-question" data-match-question>
          <h3>Is a GitHub link enough to submit?</h3>
          <DiscordMessage kind="member" time="10:32 AM"><p>Can I just share the repo?</p></DiscordMessage>
        </div>
        <div class="thread-replies">
          <div class="supported-reply" data-match-reply>
            <DiscordMessage kind="bot" time="10:32 AM">
              <div class="discord-embed"><p>Yes. Share your public GitHub repository in <span class="channel-mention">#submissions</span>.</p><a class="original-source" href="#saved-reply" data-show-source>Original answer</a></div>
              <div class="discord-actions"><button type="button" class="discord-solved" data-example-solve>Solved</button><button type="button" data-example-help>Need help</button></div>
              <span class="example-status" role="status" data-example-status></span>
            </DiscordMessage>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p class="repeat-footnote">It reads earlier replies before answering a follow-up.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="support-quiet wrap" aria-labelledby="quiet-title">
  <div class="quiet-illustration" role="img" aria-label="When no saved answer covers a question, the bot sends no reply and leaves it for a moderator."><span class="uncovered-question">No matching saved answer</span><div class="quiet-companion"><Guide pose="sleep"/></div><span class="no-reply-mark"><svg viewBox="0 0 64 64" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 10h40v30H29L12 54V10Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linejoin="round"/><path d="m18 17 28 17" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg><span>No bot reply</span></span></div>
  <div class="support-copy"><h2 id="quiet-title">Questions it<br />can’t answer.</h2><p>When no saved answer covers a question, the bot stays quiet and queues it for a moderator.</p></div>
</section>
